WEBVTT

01:11:04.460 --> 01:11:06.794
-Get outta that car!
-Move it!

01:11:09.006 --> 01:11:10.965
No! Please!
You don't understand!

01:11:11.050 --> 01:11:13.092
Buzz is out there.
We gotta help him.

01:11:13.177 --> 01:11:15.511
-No!
-Toss him overboard!

01:11:15.596 --> 01:11:17.347
No, no, no! Wait!

01:11:19.767 --> 01:11:22.352
-Hooray!
-So long, Woody!

01:11:27.900 --> 01:11:29.525
Oh! Woody!

01:11:29.902 --> 01:11:32.904
-Oh! Well, thanks for the ride.
-Look out!
